{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415034","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415034","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041503401:1":{"text":"아하하하! 털실 공이다! 데굴데굴 구르는 털실 공!","source_cn":"啊哈哈哈哈！毛线球！滚来滚去的毛线球！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x369DE25489AC74A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041503402:1":{"text":"레미아, 조용히 좀 하거라! 그리고, 내 털실 놓지 못하겠느냐!","source_cn":"蕾米雅，安静点！还有，放开我的毛线！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C2BD33D97EED5CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041503403:1":{"text":"매번 이렇게 털실 공을 꺼내서 오만 데에 늘어놓다니!","source_cn":"每次你都把毛线球拿出来，滚得满地都是！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBABDC0AD104D1A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041503404:1":{"text":"넌 이제 어린아이가 아니야. ...털실을 헝클어 놓았으면 네가 다시 정리해 놔야지!","source_cn":"你已经不是小孩子了——弄乱了毛线，就自己给我缠回去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD53860E64888FC66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041503405:1":{"text":"아니면 이리 와서 이 할미가 끊인 수프를 한 그릇 마시던지!","source_cn":"或者过来，喝一碗婆婆刚炖好的汤！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF814886F62B0599","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041503406:1":{"text":"왔어요! 전 수프가 제일 좋아요! 닭고기인가요? 아니면 생선? 뭐든 다 좋지만요!","source_cn":"来啦！我最喜欢喝汤了！是鸡？还是鱼？我都喜欢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C41DCFEDCABDBB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041503407:1":{"text":"이야아옹! 뜨거워! 혀! 내 혀!","source_cn":"喵嗷嗷嗷！好烫！舌头！我的舌头！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28CF00BDC6673B17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蕾米雅":{"text":"레미아","source":"蕾米雅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:达赫妮婆婆":{"text":"다프니 할머니","source":"达赫妮婆婆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}